      "versionNonce": 212245292,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795622890105,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SupervisorDeSupervisores (one_for_one)\n├─ StackSupervisor (one_for_one, estático)\n│   ├─ StackAgent  (permanent)\n│   ├─ Stack1      (permanent)\n│   └─ Stack2..5   (transient)\n└─ StackDynamicSupervisor (dinámico)\n    ├─ DynamicStackUno\n    └─ ...  (a pedido)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SupervisorDeSupervisores (one_for_one)\n├─ StackSupervisor (one_for_one, estático)\n│   ├─ StackAgent  (permanent)\n│   ├─ Stack1      (permanent)\n│   └─ Stack2..5   (transient)\n└─ StackDynamicSupervisor (dinámico)\n    ├─ DynamicStackUno\n    └─ ...  (a pedido)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ZF"
    },
    {
